    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="fb5dcef9-e00f-5a5f-90a4-1984f11ffaa5" activityNameId="56943921-5c0d-591e-983e-13ef2041f7ca" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Frame extension, particle board, at plant, with resource correction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Frame extension, particle board, at plant, with resource correction
The frame extension is 0.064m thick, U=0.5W/m2K. 1m2 of frame extension weighs 17.8kg. The bill of materials is based on data from frame extension manufactures.;
UUID: 8fe32e5b-770c-3e65-b433-4afea41453b6
Included are the materials used in a frame extension. The cover plate is a coated particle board. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at frame extenstion manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8fe32e5b-770c-3e65-b433-4afea41453b6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
